{"title":"Objects From Films","link":"https://kottke.org/25/09/objects-from-films","date":1757966327000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/objects-films-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/objects-films-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/objects-films-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"806\" alt=\"black &amp; white illustrations of a payphone and a TV\" /></p>\n\n<p>Artist and poet Marcus Merritt <a href=\"https://marcusjmerritt.com/objects-from-films/\">draws objects from films</a> — the TV above is from E.T. and the payphone is from Terminator 2.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/objects-films-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/objects-films-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/objects-films-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"802\" alt=\"black &amp; white illustrations of an alarm clock and a lamp\" /></p>\n\n<p>I very much dig the spare illustration style here. (via <a href=\"https://waxy.org\">waxy</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Marcus%20Merritt\">Marcus Merritt</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/movies\">movies</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/09/objects-from-films\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"7200ef5eb4aeeb6dbeb86a255592cec4ff8ede2ace000ba3eb46da046f410fdb","category":"Sites"}